CM_ "Honda CL250 vehicle bus (DLC, classic CAN 500 kbps, verified D-019). SKELETON: no passive broadcast frames are known yet (Q-001). ECU data is polled over UDS and defined in uds/vehicle_cl250.yaml, not here. Add frames only with evidence; unverified ones carry CM_ UNVERIFIED - <evidence>.";
CM_ BU_ CL250_ECU "Engine ECU (UDS physical address 0x10).";
